to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-14 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-14 = cons "- **Why capitalism stopped at the proof of concept.** A technology company earns by being in the" (cons "  middle: holding the data (lock-in), the attention (advertising) and the distribution (the store and" (cons "  the platform cut). Apps, accounts and the cloud are the form of personal computing that maximizes" (cons "  the middle; the right form removes it, so the market had every reason to stop where it pays. What" (cons "  was built is the company's endpoint in the person's pocket, not the person's own computer." nil))))
